#N canvas 40 40 481 540 12;
#X text 20 10 One playback voice. 'play <start> <length> <ms> <array>' fades in over 5 ms and plays <length> samples from <start> in <ms>. 'stop' fades out. The start goes to tabread4~'s onset inlet so positions stay precise deep into long files., f 60;
